rchivos del espacio de trabajo, sin verificación de lectura.\"\n  response response_coding_workspace_verification_failed_en\n    intent coding_workspace_verification_failed\n    language en\n    text \"Verification failed for `{path}`: the observed bytes differ from the planned workspace effect.\"\n  response response_coding_workspace_verification_failed_ru\n    intent coding_workspace_verification_failed\n    language ru\n    text \"Проверка `{path}` не удалась: считанные байты отличаются от запланированного изменения рабочей области.\"\n  response response_coding_workspace_verification_failed_hi\n    intent coding_workspace_verification_failed\n    language hi\n    text \"`{path}` का सत्यापन विफल रहा: पढ़े गए बाइट नियोजित कार्यक्षेत्र परिवर्तन से अलग हैं।\"\n  response response_coding_workspace_verification_failed_zh\n    intent coding_workspace_verification_failed\n    language zh\n    text \"`{path}` 验证失败：读取的字节与计划的工作区更改不同。\"\n  response response_coding_workspace_verification_failed_es\n    intent coding_workspace_verification_failed\n    language es\n    text \"La verificación de `{path}` falló: los bytes observados difieren del cambio planificado en el espacio de trabajo.\"\n  response response_tool_result_failed_exit_code_en\n    intent tool_result_failed_exit_code\n    language en\n    text \"The command failed: `{tool}` exited with code {exit_code}.\\n\\n```text\\n{error}\\n```\"\n  response response_tool_result_failed_exit_code_ru\n    intent tool_result_failed_exit_code\n    language ru\n    text \"Команда завершилась с ошибкой: `{tool}` завершилась с кодом {exit_code}.\\n\\n```text\\n{error}\\n```\"\n  response response_tool_result_failed_exit_code_hi\n    intent tool_result_failed_exit_code\n    language hi\n    text \"कमांड विफल रही: `{tool}` कोड {exit_code} के साथ समाप्त हुई।\\n\\n```text\\n{error}\\n```\"\n  response response_tool_result_failed_exit_code_zh\n    intent tool_result_failed_exit_code\n    language zh\n    text \"命令失败：`{tool}` 以代码 {exit_code} 退出。\\n\\n```text\\n{error}\\n```\"\n  response response_tool_result_failed_exit_code_es\n    intent tool_result_failed_exit_code\n    language es\n    text \"El comando falló: `{tool}` terminó con código {exit_code}.\\n\\n```text\\n{error}\\n```\"\n  response response_mutating_action_observed_failure_en\n    intent mutating_action_observed_failure\n    language en\n    text \"I attempted `{action}`. The step `{check}` exited {exit_code}, so completion is not verified.\"\n  response response_mutating_action_observed_failure_ru\n    intent mutating_action_observed_failure\n    language ru\n    text \"Я попытался выполнить `{action}`. Шаг `{check}` завершился с кодом {exit_code}, поэтому завершение не подтверждено.\"\n  response response_mutating_action_observed_failure_hi\n    intent mutating_action_observed_failure\n    language hi\n    text \"मैंने `{action}` चलाने का प्रयास किया। चरण `{check}` {exit_code} कोड के साथ समाप्त हुआ, इसलिए पूरा होना सत्यापित नहीं है।\"\n  response response_mutating_action_observed_failure_zh\n    intent mutating_action_observed_failure\n    language zh\n    text \"我尝试执行了 `{action}`。步骤 `{check}` 以退出码 {exit_code} 结束，因此尚未验证操作完成。\"\n  response response_mutating_action_observed_failure_es\n    intent mutating_action_observed_failure\n    language es\n    text \"Intenté ejecutar `{action}`. El paso `{check}` terminó con código {exit_code}, así que la finalización no está verificada.\"\n  response response_mutating_action_completed_en\n    intent mutating_action_completed\n    language en\n    text \"Completed the action `{action}` and verified it with {checks}.\"\n  response response_mutating_action_completed_ru\n    intent mutating_action_completed\n    language ru\n    text \"Действие `{action}` выполнено и проверено командами {checks}.\"\n  response response_mutating_action_completed_hi\n    intent mutating_action_completed\n    language hi\n    text \"क्रिया `{action}` पूरी हुई और {checks} से सत्यापित की गई।\"\n  response response_mutating_action_completed_zh\n    intent mutating_action_completed\n    language zh\n    text \"已完成操作 `{action}`，并通过 {checks} 进行了验证。\"\n  response response_mutating_action_completed_es\n    intent mutating_action_completed\n    language es\n    text \"Se completó la acción `{action}` y se verificó con {checks}.\"\n  response response_mutating_action_blocked_en\n    intent mutating_action_blocked\n    language en\n    text \"I did not run `{action}`. The check `{check}` exited {exit_code}, so the action was skipped and nothing in the workspace changed.\"\n  response response_mutating_action_blocked_ru\n    intent mutating_action_blocked\n    language ru\n    text \"Я не выполнил `{action}`. Проверка `{check}` завершилась с кодом {exit_code}, поэтому действие пропущено и в рабочем каталоге ничего не изменилось.\"\n  response response_mutating_action_blocked_hi\n    intent mutating_action_blocked\n    language hi\n    text \"मैंने `{action}` नहीं चलाया। जाँच `{check}` {exit_code} कोड के साथ समाप्त हुई, इसलिए क्रिया छोड़ दी गई और कार्यक्षेत्र में कुछ नहीं बदला।\"\n  response response_mutating_action_blocked_zh\n    intent mutating_action_blocked\n    language zh\n    text \"我没有执行 `{action}`。检查 `{check}` 以退出码 {exit_code} 结束，因此跳过了该操作，工作区没有发生任何变化。\"\n  response response_mutating_action_blocked_es\n    intent mutating_action_blocked\n    language es\n    text \"No ejecuté `{action}`. La comprobación `{check}` terminó con código {exit_code}, así que se omitió la acción y nada cambió en el espacio de trabajo.\"\n  response response_coding_repository_source_observation_en\n    intent coding_repository_source_observation\n    language en\n    text \"{result} (observed in repository source).\"\n  response response_coding_repository_source_observation_ru\n    intent coding_repository_source_observation\n    language ru\n    text \"{result} (наблюдается в исходном коде репозитория).\"\n  response response_coding_repository_source_observation_hi\n    intent coding_repository_source_observation\n    language hi\n    text \"{result} (रिपॉज़िटरी स्रोत में देखा गया)।\"\n  response response_coding_repository_source_observation_zh\n    intent coding_repository_source_observation\n    language zh\n    text \"{result}（在仓库源代码中观察到）。\"\n  response response_coding_repository_source_observation_es\n    intent coding_repository_source_observation\n    language es\n    text \"{result} (observado en el código fuente del repositorio).\"\n  response response_coding_repository_result_observation_en\n    intent coding_repository_result_observation\n    language en\n    text \"Observed repository result: {result}\"\n  response response_coding_repository_result_observation_ru\n    intent coding_repository_result_observation\n    language ru\n    text \"Результат, наблюдаемый в репозитории: {result}\"\n  response response_coding_repository_result_observation_hi\n    intent coding_repository_result_observation\n    language hi\n    text \"रिपॉज़िटरी में देखा गया परिणाम: {result}\"\n  response response_coding_repository_result_observation_zh\n    intent coding_repository_result_observation\n    language zh\n    text \"在仓库中观察到的结果：{result}\"\n  response response_coding_repository_result_observation_es\n    intent coding_repository_result_observation\n    language es\n    text \"Resultado observado en el repositorio: {result}\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_report_en\n    intent agentic_formalization_report\n    language en\n    text \"Formalized {subject} into a Links Notation knowledge base: {records} records realising {covered_count} of {primitive_count} protocol primitives ({coverage}).\\n\\nKnowledge base ({path}):\\n\\n{kb}\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_report_ru\n    intent agentic_formalization_report\n    language ru\n    text \"Источник {subject} формализован в базу знаний Links Notation: {records} записей, реализовано {covered_count} из {primitive_count} примитивов протокола ({coverage}).\\n\\nБаза знаний ({path}):\\n\\n{kb}\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_report_hi\n    intent agentic_formalization_report\n    language hi\n    text \"{subject} को Links Notation ज्ञान आधार में औपचारिक किया: {records} रिकॉर्ड, {primitive_count} में से {covered_count} प्रोटोकॉल मूल तत्व मौजूद हैं ({coverage})।\\n\\nज्ञान आधार ({path}):\\n\\n{kb}\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_report_zh\n    intent agentic_formalization_report\n    language zh\n    text \"已将 {subject} 形式化为 Links Notation 知识库：{records} 条记录，实现了 {primitive_count} 种协议原语中的 {covered_count} 种（{coverage}）。\\n\\n知识库（{path}）：\\n\\n{kb}\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_report_es\n    intent agentic_formalization_report\n    language es\n    text \"Se formalizó {subject} en una base de conocimiento Links Notation: {records} registros que representan {covered_count} de {primitive_count} primitivas del protocolo ({coverage}).\\n\\nBase de conocimiento ({path}):\\n\\n{kb}\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_need_report_en\n    intent agentic_formalization_need_report\n    language en\n    text \"needs_raised {total}; needs_grounded {grounded}.\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_need_report_ru\n    intent agentic_formalization_need_report\n    language ru\n    text \"Потребностей поднято: {total}; обосновано: {grounded}.\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_need_report_hi\n    intent agentic_formalization_need_report\n    language hi\n    text \"उठाई गई आवश्यकताएँ: {total}; प्रमाणित: {grounded}।\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_need_report_zh\n    intent agentic_formalization_need_report\n    language zh\n    text \"提出的需求 {total}；已获依据 {grounded}。\"\n  response response_agentic_formalization_need_report_es\n    intent agentic_formalization_need_report\n    language es\n    text \"Necesidades planteadas: {total}; fundamentadas: {grounded}.\"\n  response response_file_analysis_heading_en\n    intent file_analysis_heading\n    language en\n    text \"Bounded audit evidence from {count} file(