e\n    precondition \"the client advertises workspace file reads\"\n    effect \"the calling client receives the path parameter schema\"\n    unit \"not applicable\"\n    example \"read_file path\"\n    lexeme en \"workspace file read schema\"\n    lexeme ru \"схема чтения файла\"\n    lexeme hi \"फ़ाइल पढ़ने का प्रारूप\"\n    lexeme zh \"文件读取格式\"\n    lexeme es \"esquema de lectura de archivo\"\n  general-plan-append-action\n    defined-by answer\n    role localized_response_template\n    precondition \"a composed plan has a stable event identity\"\n    effect \"the action describes persistence that retains earlier events\"\n    unit \"not applicable\"\n    example \"append a plan event\"\n    lexeme en \"plan event append description\"\n    lexeme ru \"описание добавления плана\"\n    lexeme hi \"योजना घटना जोड़ने का वर्णन\"\n    lexeme zh \"计划事件追加说明\"\n    lexeme es \"descripción de anexar evento de plan\"\n»"
