chor}`, результат проверен.\"\n  response response_line_moved_before_hi\n    intent line_moved_before\n    language hi\n    text \"`{path}` में `{old}` को `{anchor}` से पहले ले जाया और परिणाम सत्यापित किया।\"\n  response response_line_moved_before_zh\n    intent line_moved_before\n    language zh\n    text \"已在 `{path}` 中将 `{old}` 移到 `{anchor}` 之前并验证了结果。\"\n  response response_line_moved_before_es\n    intent line_moved_before\n    language es\n    text \"Se movió `{old}` antes de `{anchor}` en `{path}` y se verificó el resultado.\"\n  response response_lines_swapped_en\n    intent lines_swapped\n    language en\n    text \"Swapped `{old}` and `{new}` in `{path}` and observed the result.\"\n  response response_lines_swapped_ru\n    intent lines_swapped\n    language ru\n    text \"В `{path}` строки `{old}` и `{new}` поменяны местами, результат проверен.\"\n  response response_lines_swapped_hi\n    intent lines_swapped\n    language hi\n    text \"`{path}` में `{old}` और `{new}` की अदला-बदली की और परिणाम सत्यापित किया।\"\n  response response_lines_swapped_zh\n    intent lines_swapped\n    language zh\n    text \"已在 `{path}` 中交换 `{old}` 与 `{new}` 并验证了结果。\"\n  response response_lines_swapped_es\n    intent lines_swapped\n    language es\n    text \"Se intercambiaron `{old}` y `{new}` en `{path}` y se verificó el resultado.\"\n  response response_coding_workspace_fragment_refused_en\n    intent coding_workspace_fragment_refused\n    language en\n    text \"Refused to change `{path}`: the computed result would drop most of the file, and the request does not ask for that.\"\n  response response_coding_workspace_fragment_refused_ru\n    intent coding_workspace_fragment_refused\n    language ru\n    text \"Изменение `{path}` отклонено: вычисленный результат удалил бы большую часть файла, а запрос этого не просит.\"\n  response response_coding_workspace_fragment_refused_hi\n    intent coding_workspace_fragment_refused\n    language hi\n    text \"`{path}` में परिवर्तन अस्वीक